+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * Device Tree Source extras for U-Boot for the GR Mango board
+ * Based on GR Peach, Copyright (C) 2019 Marek Vasut <marek.vasut@gmail.com>
+ */
